      "seed": 2069613872,
      "version": 587,
      "versionNonce": 385843940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780416767953,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in case of liquidation; RLC is sold for USDC, which is used to repay;\nsince iExec provides USDC, it is equivalent to a delayed direct funding in USDC\n\ncaveat: other borrowers may show up, in which case need more USDC in the Morpho market\nsupply\n\nliquidation absorption constraint: uniliquidity ~ B=0.6\n\nthe full integration wraps a direct perpetual credit contract \nb/w Ellen cap and IExec (or w maturity if we use Midnight)\n",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in case of liquidation; RLC is sold for USDC, which is used to repay;\nsince iExec provides USDC, it is equivalent to a delayed direct funding in USDC\n\ncaveat: other borrowers may show up, in which case need more USDC in the Morpho market\nsupply\n\nliquidation absorption constraint: uniliquidity ~ B=0.6\n\nthe full integration wraps a direct perpetual credit contract \nb/w Ellen cap and IExec (or w maturity if we use Midnight)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
